b(1, col_y) = dn_dx(i,1); // duy/dy   ← v-derivative w.r.t y → ε_yy
b(2, col_x) = dn_dx(i,1); // dux/dy   ← u-derivative w.r.t y → part of γ_xy
b(2, col_y) = dn_dx(i,0); // duy/dx   ← v-derivative w.r.t x → part of γ_xy
```

✅ This is **correct** for `γ_xy = ∂u/∂y + ∂v/∂x`.

